		},
		{
			"id": 2010315,
			"completionStepIds": [],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_OR",
				"conditions": [
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL",
						"rawParams": [
							"2010302",
							"2"
						],
						"stepId": 2010302,
						"stateName": "QUEST_STATE_UNFINISHED"
					},
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL",
						"rawParams": [
							"2010303",
							"2"
						],
						"stepId": 2010303,
						"stateName": "QUEST_STATE_UNFINISHED"
					}
				]
			},
			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"Ella Musk"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 201031501,
					"content": "I wonder if the hilichurls will like my poetry...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						201031502,
						201031509,
						201031515
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ella Musk"
				},
				{
					"id": 201031502,
					"content": "What inspired you to write Hilichurlian poetry?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						201031503
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 201031503,
					"content": "Honestly, it's because I want to improve my language skills. There's certain grammatical rules, sentence structures, lexical collocations and so on where I haven't quite grasped everything.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						201031504
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ella Musk"
				},
				{
					"id": 201031504,
					"content": "I put an enormous amount of hard work into writing these lines, but who knows — they might still sound clumsy and unnatural to a native speaker.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						201031505
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ella Musk"
				},
				{
					"id": 201031505,
					"content": "Sometimes just one wrong word choice creates the wrong connotation, and then you've changed the meaning of the entire sentence... There's only one way to learn little nuances like that, and that is to talk to an actual hilichurl.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						201031506
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ella Musk"
				},
				{
					"id": 201031506,
					"content": "Most people find the idea of learning Hilichurlian directly from the hilichurls to be intolerable.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						201031507
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ella Musk"
				},
				{
					"id": 201031507,
					"content": "But not me. If I'm serious about getting proficient in Hilichurlian and understand their culture, this is something I have to do.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						201031508
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ella Musk"
				},
				{
					"id": 201031508,
					"content": "And what could be a more fitting way to communicate with Mondstadt's hilichurls than through the medium of poetry?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Ella Musk"
				},
				{
					"id": 201031509,
					"content": "What are these comments?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						201031510
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 201031510,
					"content": "Oh, the ones at the very end? Yeah... So, all the vocabulary in these poems I have definitely seen before in other texts...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						201031511
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ella Musk"
				},
				{
					"id": 201031511,
					"content": "And with each word, I did try my best to take cues from the original usage conditions as I pieced the sentences together...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						201031512
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ella Musk"
				},
				{
					"id": 201031512,
					"content": "...But languages are complex things. Sometimes, even the most benign-seeming word can change meaning when used in a specific context, enough to affect the meaning of the entire sentence...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						201031513
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ella Musk"
				},
				{
					"id": 201031513,
					"content": "Anyway. These verses are the ones I'm most confident on in terms of comprehension. Relatively speaking.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						201031514
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ella Musk"
				},
				{
					"id": 201031514,
					"content": "I've got other verses that I still don't know how to translate into Common, even though I wrote them... I'll spare you those ones.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Ella Musk"
				},
				{
					"id": 201031515,
					"content": "Seems to me you've more or less figured it out already...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						201031516
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 201031516,
					"content": "Well... \"more or less\" is still a far cry from \"completely.\" And even though I set out to achieve a friendly interaction with the hilichurls...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						201031517
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ella Musk"
				},
				{
					"id": 201031517,
					"content": "...I doubt they would give me the chance to explain if something didn't come across as I intended. More likely, they'd get riled up and I wouldn't make it back in one piece...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						201031518
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ella Musk"
				},
				{
					"id": 201031518,
					"content": "So. That's where you come in! Hehehe. ...You'll be fine, honest! Just follow my notes and you will almost certainly have no problems whatsoever.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						201031519
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ella Musk"
				},
				{
					"id": 201031519,
					"content": "Almost certainly...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Ella Musk"
				}
			]
		},
